BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: CHAD (Chapel Hill & Durham Fun)
UID:event_315727930@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260803T040423Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260806T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260806T200000
SUMMARY:Free Medieval Combat Training (Hillsborough\, NC) - Broadsword - A
 rmor - Rapier
DESCRIPTION:Chapel Hill And Durham Fun with Friends (CHAD) 30s 40s 50s+\nL
 earn the European martial art of broadsword and shield\, wearing steel arm
 or. Or maybe Renaissance dueling with rapier and dagger is more your style
 . Beginners welcome! No experience necessary. Some loaner armor is availab
 le.\n\nRapier instructor: Elsbeth von Uberwald\, OD\nBroadsword instructor
 : William of Bedford\, KSCA\nAdministrator (KM): Charles Fleming\n*This ev
 ent is held and managed by the [Canton of Buckston-on-Eno](https://bucksto
 n.windmastershill.org)\, a branch of the* [Society for Creative Anachronis
 m\, Inc.](https://welcome.sca.org/) *and is considered the Official channe
 l of this group here. Questions regarding its content should be directed t
 o [chatelain@buckston.atlantia.sca.org](http://chatelaine@buckston.windmas
 tershill.org) or to [socialmedia@sca.org.](http://socialmedia@sca.org.) In
 clusion of external links does not indicate implicit nor explicit endorsem
 ent of any content or products.*
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/chad2015/events/315727930/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260717T220536Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260717T220536Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
